1º Frontend users:
	 cwdfront;
	 module load mpich3/gcc; 

2º Update Hitmap path (HITMAP_PATH) in CMakeList.txt

3º Recompile Hitmap 
	cd Hitmap1.3:
	make clean; make
	cd ..

4º Create "build" directory and Makefiles
	mkdir build; cd build; cmake .. ; cd ..

5º Compile all 
	sh compile.sh

6º Checking
	./check.py

7º Executing an example

	srun --gres=gpu:1 -p dark-night -w hydra -n 1 ./build/examples_gpu/matrixAdd/matrixAddCuda 4 1 0

The source codes are in ./examples_xxx/  (xxx = (cpu|gpu#xphi))
The generated files are in the ./build/examples_xxx/ 
